# PC card team-concord (TMODE-33 CONCORD, BENCH-150): bb (A/A) against aa on the picked teams, the gate's fresh seeds from 6800. Template: ccprep writes work/team-concord-gbb.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
--team
true
--seeds
16
--seed-base
6800
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
work/team-concord-gate.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@bb.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@bb
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-concord-@V@-gbb
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-concord-gbb.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
